Serena (sano-it), a sanoTTS voice by Ampixa

sanoTTS's it-serena-1p57m, 1.57M parameters, distilled from Piper's it_IT-serena-medium, trained on
serena-synthetic-it-27h (Committa, https://huggingface.co/datasets/committa/serena-synthetic-it-27h), licensed
under CC BY 4.0: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/. It is synthetic speech made with Qwen3-TTS-1.7B-Base
from a fixed synthetic reference voice, reading sentences mostly from Tatoeba (https://tatoeba.org), CC BY 2.0 FR.
Its weights are under the GPL-3.0 beside this file (Ampixa, https://huggingface.co/ampixa/sanoTTS). The source of
its weights, of sanoTTS's runtime and of the espeak-ng it reads phonemes with is in patai_node_xavier's
voices-sources release: https://github.com/patrickwasp/patai_node_xavier/releases/tag/voices-sources.
